# Lucky.Engine .gitignore
# Prevents personal data and private configs from leaking to GitHub

## Memory Data (Do NOT commit these)
memory/*.md
memory/*.txt
memory/graphify-out/graph.json
memory/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
memory/graphify-out/manifest.json
memory/corpus/

## Personal Credentials
*.keys
*.pem
secrets.json
.env

## Generated Files
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.pylintrc
.idea/
.vscode/

## Logs
*.log
logs/
